	s(fHash, `return wymix(a^wyK1, b^seed) ^ wymix(seed^wyK2, uint64(n)^wyK0)`, `return wymix(a^wyK1, b^seed)`, `wyhash: final mix shortened`)
	s(fSort, `blockSize := 20 // must be > 0`, `blockSize := 10 // must be > 0`, `stableSort: block of 10`)
	s(fSort, `blockSize := 20 // must be > 0`, `blockSize := 40 // must be > 0`, `stableSort: block of 40`)
	s(fLib, `if s.odd = !s.odd; !s.odd {`, `if s.odd = !s.odd; s.odd {`, `sortSlice.Swap: the odd swap is charged`)
